description: Put at most one runnable command per fenced code block
alwaysApply: true
---

# One command per block

- In every fenced code block that contains shell/terminal commands, include **at most one** command to run.
- If multiple steps are needed, use **separate** fenced blocks (one command each), in order.
- Do not combine `cd ...` and `npm ...` in the same block unless the user explicitly asked for a one-liner script.
